  "goodToKnow": "Die Empore is a raised gallery in a church or hall, often where the organ and choir are. Many Protestant churches have Emporen to fit large congregations. It comes from empor, a literary word for upwards: empor steigen, emporragen (to tower), sich emporarbeiten (to work one's way up). Plural: die Emporen."
